{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "96f63d5276a8ac09d7c8ca114a25dc08f3c8dcd49ccdff32ac5af79dc8fb9fcd", "ja": "受けとめろ、どっさりお菓子", "zh": "接招吧，海量点心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8a18991d64a36da4fc8a676a731d26b3c3e23b816867e51c99af8d8a629879da", "ja": "公演は大好評！　打ち上げはみんなでお菓子\n作りをする事に。日頃のお礼にと差し出され\nる大量のお菓子を前に、胃薬を覚悟するプロ\nデューサーなのだった。", "zh": "公演大受好评！　庆功会决定由大家一起制作点心。面对以答谢平日照顾为名送来的大量点心，制作人只好做好服用胃药的觉悟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "629e172d7a5ed6787d83eb2a3cf63b7383cb450968cfb88406ef7ef80776de10", "ja": "（ステージは、大きな拍手に包まれた。\nみんなの頑張りが光った公演だったな……）", "zh": "（舞台被热烈的掌声包围了。大家都竭尽全力，这是一场闪耀着大家努力成果的公演啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3b31ddf350d4872e4721c7837b46239be6621c10b4612d1d1abfc74d4a1f05b5", "ja": "（打ち上げはみんなの希望で、\nキッチンスタジオを借りての、お菓子作りだ）", "zh": "（按照大家的心愿，庆功宴是在租来的厨房工作室里做点心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "a57faae5ebfded8a6aed302337a744b99acbdbb35847c64e1eabbd2189273555", "ja": "おからパウダーを入れて、\n粉っぽくなくなるまで、まぜる……！", "zh": "加入豆渣粉，搅拌……！\n直到不再有粉末感为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "456b439dac967c49b1d572156ff1fcd220905a054aeda225b094ce3a7ec95f8f", "ja": "やよいさん、\nこんなかんじでだいじょうぶかな？", "zh": "弥生小姐，\n弄成这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "bf052342c4832e2c3d402a42ba0d904c0df3161d20008300d2f8b3fbf18d7699", "ja": "うん、いい感じだよ！\nそれじゃあ、これを冷やして固めよっか。", "zh": "嗯，感觉很棒哦！\n那接下来，把这个冷藏凝固一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "3e0f4c16cecd39810c2c504d5b24077b7ab21566d7e742ccfd5d97164f1835f8", "ja": "待ってる間に、クッキー型を選ばない？\nかわいい形のやつを買ってきたんだ♪", "zh": "趁着等待的时间，要不要先选一下饼干模具？\n我买了好几种可爱造型的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "4b3f87040502efcad810487f9705cd5b863804d40035a628c68a283bf658f50a", "ja": "わぁ、かわいい♪\nそれじゃあみんな、好きな型を選んでね！", "zh": "哇，好可爱♪\n那大家选自己喜欢的模具吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "59099639d4666b612a46b1d71a75fae3f732a6ca1ec348d33f04e0362683a17f", "ja": "揚げる時は、低温の油でじっくり……\n最後はきつね色になるまで……。", "zh": "炸的时候，要用低温的油慢慢炸……  \n最后炸到呈金黄色为止……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "952d44182f173995f66e5b3d9f9882ad117dff7c8ab262f9eb4a3e1f75c1aed7", "ja": "ひびきー！\nたまき、できるかな……？", "zh": "响——！\n环，能做到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "9829b436229a9c8b811e94157339d40107ef69acc525038678b564e466654861", "ja": "大丈夫さー！　ちゃんと見守っていれば\nサーターアンダギーは必ず応えてくれるよ！", "zh": "没问题的啦！只要好好看着，\n开口笑就一定会回应你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "3b28e1ff77f4def3df269af859a93c7675d978ebb3c4707f4fa86390ffda6a8e", "ja": "安心しなさい、環！\nこの伊織ちゃんがついてるんだから♪", "zh": "放心吧，环！\n有我伊织在呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "b3d33c01a80bc720a6c15e84aea4613f9c2a1c34f7811803c2868e4e80d6f61e", "ja": "う、うん！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8d528a4e475404cbf63a886cc7f13b825bddb85c9aa2ca6099e9fd2cda15ed95", "ja": "あとは、おからクッキーが焼きあがるのを待つだけか。\nお菓子作り、すっかりブームだな。", "zh": "接下来只要等豆渣饼干烤好就行了吧。\n做点心已经彻底成了潮流啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f47def6f5382738090f0f34bb689aaec8bb3f8ec1d2eccdc8ddd2117a4b89a3e", "ja": "打ち上げのお菓子作りは、\n育が希望したんだって？", "zh": "听说庆功宴上的点心是育提议要做的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "ea973c89bc4173942c8328d34105a933f2a97cf11c400b2cb7d4fade22bc9294", "ja": "うん！　伊織さんとのおかし作り、すごく\n楽しかったから。今度はみんなでやりたいなって！", "zh": "嗯！因为和伊织姐姐一起做点心特别开心。所以我想下次和大家一起做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "b3654317f4e9a98a86af1f8499d169ce6284a6cfa28b259da21d8ba2a1097b47", "ja": "いい勝負ができたのは、みんながいたからだもん。\nけんとうをたたえあわないと。", "zh": "能进行一场精彩的较量，都是多亏了大家在嘛。\n必须要互相称赞彼此的奋战才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "69cc0287c551953d2cfc1134df668b3564b76f4183b0cb626e5e13ec982845fa", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n素晴らしい心がけだと思う。", "zh": "嗯，你说得对。\n这种想法真的很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1a35e32402735fe9e61b08a7b310f68c0f1b2d6b6cf93b78adf3dbcea8ff7466", "ja": "（勝負は終わったっていうのに、\n育のいい子っぷりは留まるところを知らないな）", "zh": "（明明比赛都结束了，育的乖巧劲儿还是停不下来啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8b4536e386e3efc2c0ef052dd5d1c0fd4c17d2c54d2e1bc30b0d68e42ce304ae", "ja": "（いや、それはみんなもか。これからもその魅力、\n大いに発揮していってもらわないと）", "zh": "（不，大家也是一样吧。今后也必须让大家充分发挥出这份魅力才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "f5b4d7541136885f441f4a37bb50dbe341ed48bd4989c1d8242df2943ea3c33e", "ja": "それでね、{$P$}さんにも\nおかしをプレゼントしたくて！", "zh": "所以呢，我也想给{$P$}先生送些点心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6a16d2d0f9df99baf5c61cc12712ebfaab2f09d67569ac52973680e2e334e3cd", "ja": "え？　お菓子をくれるのか？", "zh": "咦？你要送我点心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "b6e5c2aedae01aabc846b99340e3aec7de92c8f0d61574172d6f2d51e4381ed9", "ja": "うん！\nいつもプロデュースありがとう、の気持ち！", "zh": "嗯！\n这是对一直以来承蒙你制作的感谢之情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "750934ccf663a8a46eea9c6e15a5cee8e3bbd07e7b56e6f1f4438a0054b47316", "ja": "いつもありがとうございます！\nおからクッキー、たくさん焼きましたから！", "zh": "一直以来都非常感谢您！\n我烤了好多豆渣饼干哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "81f4660726375d84bddee3829d85456f6f1e81ac743daaedc4d0c13d91c7ea03", "ja": "お兄ちゃんのは、大きいクッキーにしたよ。\n特別にね！", "zh": "哥哥的，我做成大饼干了。\n这是特别给你的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "685eb2ece09c08ad8064520752ac8bcb6600fb1ccd48c392cfcc59ef3a58d1c6", "ja": "たまきも！　おやぶん用に、すっごく大きい\nサーターアンダギーにしたぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "环也做了！给老大做了一个超级大的冲绳甜甜圈哦～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "fccb3c6802d7a4608c395c738420673c57e1e24a309adeae0adfeb2e500a0a0d", "ja": "生クリームとかアイスを添えてもおいしいんだ！\n自分がデコレーションしてあげるからね♪", "zh": "加上鲜奶油或者冰淇淋也很好吃哦！\n我来帮你装饰吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "e90f16dab6b71320dafebea3daaa0edda0edf35f4ac51cf7d99c0883c8d96e0f", "ja": "{$P$}、\nまさか受け取れないわけないわよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，你该不会不肯收下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a1cd014b4c0a2e1e83749b60481a8a1a37d8b6f453af33231dabf93765e9c17b", "ja": "も、もちろん。\nありがたくいただくとも！", "zh": "当然、当然。\n我很乐意收下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9b484253c07087a28bf639c1ee3c8aa638a16db5d702ffcea16ab6f4d526746b", "ja": "（この量……いや、後で胃薬を飲めばいける！）", "zh": "（这分量……不，之后吃点胃药就没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0431_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "95da86413bfbba2ef39a8369955f68b61c0ae73b866bac59d58b33fa67d0667c", "ja": "（みんなからの気持ちを無駄にするわけには\nいかない。全力で受け止めてみせるぞ！）", "zh": "（我不能辜负大家的心意。就让我全力接下这份心意吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
